// REQUIRED: local replaces to work around the go-cqrs-lite publish bug where
// submodule go.mod files use zero pseudo-versions (v4.0.0-00010101000000-000000000000)
// for sibling requires. Despite the tag-release.sh script stripping `replace`
// directives, it does NOT re-resolve the `require` lines, so the broken
// pseudo-versions are exposed at publish time. As of 2026-07-18 this affects
// 13 of ~40 submodule LATEST tags (v4.0.1/v4.0.2 included), not just v4.0.0.
// Do NOT remove these replaces until go-cqrs-lite cuts a clean consolidated
// release (v4.0.3+ or v4.1.0) from a tree where every submodule go.mod has
// been `go mod tidy`-resolved against real published versions. See
// go-cqrs-lite/scripts/tag-release.sh for the broken release flow and
// /home/lars/projects/docs/status/2026-07-18_08-58_go-cqrs-lite-latest-tag-build-alignment.md
// (appendix) for the full audit of which tags are clean vs broken.
replace github.com/larsartmann/go-cqrs-lite => /home/lars/projects/go-cqrs-lite

replace github.com/larsartmann/go-cqrs-lite/catalog/v4 => /home/lars/projects/go-cqrs-lite/catalog

